Interpretation and limits
=========================
The two successful budget stops still differ by one delivered #PF, five IRQ0
edges and five total IRQ deliveries, and 28 UART bytes. The diagnostic made reliable-frame
correlation possible but did not explain these machine/UART differences.
The strict comparator was not run on these standalone artifacts and remains
unchanged. No claim is made about wall-time overhead or physical Linux
acceptance. S5-07 remains blocked/unaccepted pending strict-clean counted
series evidence and resolution of remaining differences.
